The two production fixes are present in the reviewed backend: the neutral key claim is installed under the same global-lock section as the existence check, and cancellation stores the receipt before releasing the per-run cancel lock. I’m checking the remaining edge semantics and whether the exact test file exists in `HEAD`; no broad search will be performed.
